  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given integration is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mn>48</mn><msqrt><mn>9</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>We know that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><msqrt><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p>So, the equation can be re-written as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mn>48</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><msup><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>48</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></math></p>"
